Combined remove, append, and set operations in one call.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
description: A test plan
tags:
- tag1
priority: high
---

# Test Plan Content

This is a test plan.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --remove description tags="--append tag2" priority="medium"
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Test Plan
-description: A test plan
 tags:
 - tag1
+- tag2
-priority: high
+priority: medium
 ---

 # Test Plan Content
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
tags:
- tag1
- tag2
priority: medium

# Test Plan Content

This is a test plan.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: -description, tags=+tag2, priority=medium